<title>ITALY: Italian jobless rate rises to 12.5 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Italian jobless rate rises to 12.5 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute</p>
<p>ISTAT gave the following unemployment data in its quarterly</p>
<p>report.</p>
<p>    ITALIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	    April 97    Jan 97    April 96</p>
<p>    Pct unemployed		     12.5	  12.4	12.3</p>
<p>    Number of unemployed (million) 2.87	  2.81	2.82</p>
</text>
